  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3010.01 Civil Penalties",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3010.01 Civil Penalties. Any person who commits the following shall be subject to a civil penalty not to exceed $25,000 for each violation and each day of continuing violation:\n\n(a) A violation of Env-A 3009.01(a), Env-A 3009.01(b), or Env-A 3009.01(c); or\n\n(b) An omission of material information in connection with the certification of ERCs; or\n\n(c) Any false statement or representation in connection with the certification of ERCs.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3000.html"
}
